# Safety

This repository is a **prototype**. Do not claim ISO 26262, ASIL, or certified safe state.

- One fault state machine (`fault_mgr`). Do not fork a second SM.
- Critical path: detect → debounce → DTC → DEGRADED or SAFE_STATE.
- Prototype safe state: TX silent / default GPIO, keep diagnostics if possible.
- FMEA lives in `docs/safety/` when written; distinguish prototype vs production.

```c
/* BAD */
/* ISO 26262 ASIL-B compliant watchdog */

/* GOOD */
/* Prototype WDT feeder. Not an ASIL-rated safety mechanism. */
